Derived from
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DuelSight is derived from Kenbunshoku (https://github.com/ryangswe/kenbunshoku, Apache-2.0),
the extension for the One Piece Card Game, starting from its commit 8a319d7, and runs the
cardvision toolkit's browser runtime (https://github.com/ryangswe/riftsight-vision, Apache-2.0).
Kenbunshoku's license and attribution notices are kept: this file is the DuelSight notice and
adds to them, it does not replace them.

