Not affiliated
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DuelSight is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Konami. Yu-Gi-Oh!,
its card names and its card art belong to their owners. This repository and the extension's
package contain no card images and no card text: both are served from DuelSight's card CDN.

Card text and images are copyright 4K Media Inc., a subsidiary of Konami Digital Entertainment.
Card data from YGOPRODeck.

